    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Ben Pieratt: solo freelance brand and product designer/namer, NYC. Senior, 15+ years; founded Svpply (acquired by eBay 2012), plus self-initiated projects (Hessian, Lookwork, Dead Bookstore). Specializes in naming, logo/identity and product design, much of it for startups and Web3 (Zora, Mirror, dYdX, ARTBLX). Charges ~$250/hr in 20-hour units or ~$5,000/engagement (his own site). Freelance: his own site explicitly sells his services and lists rates; high autonomy, runs engagements solo. Tagged Copywriting; core work is naming + brand voice (Pronoun naming deck, Electric Objects brand foundation copy, Dead Bookstore tagline); also writes essays on naming methodology (blog.pieratt.com, 2010-2023). LinkedIn not found: site lists Twitter/X and Tumblr only; WebFetch to linkedin.com returns 999 (blocked logged-out). IG context shot queued (ig-queue.json): logged-out Playwright returned cookie consent modal blocking profile grid. Sources: pieratt.com, blog.pieratt.com, web search.",
